@startuml C4_Search_Operation_Plans_Logical_Deployment
title C4 – Operation Plan Search (Logical Deployment View)
left to right direction

skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}

skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor HoneyDew
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

node "Device" as Device {
  artifact "Angular SPA" as Spa
}

node "PLMS Network" as PlmsNet {
  artifact "TodoApi Proxy" as Proxy
  artifact "Telemetry Agent" as Telemetry
}

cloud "OEM SaaS" as OemSaaS {
  artifact "Operation Plans API" as OemApi
  artifact "Query Worker" as QueryWorker
  artifact "Metadata Cache" as Cache
}

cloud "IAM" as IAM

Operator --> Spa : HTTPS interaction
Spa --> Proxy : GET /api/oem/operation-plans
Proxy --> OemApi : Forward REST call
Proxy --> IAM : Token validation, claim refresh
OemApi --> QueryWorker : Build query + fetch from DB
QueryWorker --> Cache : optional caching of results
OemApi --> Proxy : JSON list
Proxy --> Telemetry : Emit metrics
Proxy --> Spa : Return data

@enduml
